SUMMARY:Second Saturday: Free Family Day at MSC
DESCRIPTION:Every second Saturday of the month enjoy free admission all day long at the Museum of Sonoma County. \nThis month explore the exhibitions the museum has on view including a new exhibition featuring the history of Santa Rosa! We will be displaying rarely seen maps of the city\, showcasing centuries of change and expansion.\nAfterwards check out our 36th Annual Artistry in Wood exhibition and get inspired to make your own leaf print. \nActivities from 11 am to 1 pm.\nMuseum is open from 11 am to 5 pm.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/second-saturday-free-family-day-at-msc/
LOCATION:Museum of Sonoma County\, 425 7th St\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Art,Kids and Family
