UID:10018838-1775916000-1775926800@golocal.coop
SUMMARY:Under the Pink Moon — A Spring Celebration in Historic Duncans Mills
DESCRIPTION:.On Saturday\, April 11 from 2 to 5 PM\, Duncans Mills Candle Co. and the merchant village of historic Duncans Mills celebrate the Pink Moon of April! \nApril’s full moon has been called the Pink Moon for centuries — named not for the color of the sky\, but for wild pink phlox \, one of the first flowers to bloom each spring. It became kown as the full moon of fresh starts\, new beginnings\, and stepping back outside. This year the Pink Moon rises on April 1 — and we’re honoring it all month long. Come celebrate with us on April 11 in Duncans Mills. \nBlend your own custom signature scent at the DIY Fragrance Bar and take it home. Sip a complimentary Rosato tasting from Muscardini Cellars\, poured at Sophie’s Cellars. Design a one-of-a-kind bracelet or necklace at the Charm Bar by Mason James. Get a tarot card reading from local writer and reader Tania Pryputniewicz. Bring the kids to the Candle Bar for a grab-and-go wax bead creation. Visit Christopher Queen Galleries latest show\, Spring Flourish. And let the Bohoss Boogie Boys set the afternoon soundtrack with live music from start to finish. \nThe event is free\, all-ages\, and perfectly timed with April’s full Pink Moon — a symbol of renewal\, new beginnings\, and the quiet beauty of spring in Sonoma County. \nPink attire suggested. \nWHAT’S HAPPENING: \nDIY Fragrance Bar at the Duncans Mills Candle Co.— blend your own scent to take home\nComplimentary Rosato tasting by Muscardini Cellars at Sophie’s Cellars\nTarot Card Readings by Tania Pryputniewicz at Poet’s Corner Bookshop\nCharm Bar at Mason James — custom bracelets & necklaces\nKids Candle Bar at the Duncans Mills Candle Co. — grab and go with scented wax beads\nLive Music by the Bohoss Boogie Boys in the town square\nSpring Flourish Art Show at Christopher Queen Galleries\nIn-store specials and event-only promotions \nMORE INFO:\nduncansmillscandleco.com\n(707) 503-8863\nInstagram/Facebook @duncansmillscandleco
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/under-the-pink-moon-a-spring-celebration-in-historic-duncans-mills/
LOCATION:Duncans Mills Candle Co.\, 25171 CA-116\, Duncans Mills\, 95430
CATEGORIES:Art,Kids and Family,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Under-the-Pink-Moon-Duncans-Mills-s.jpg
END:VEVENT
