SUMMARY:WALDO Limited Release Party w/Garden Groove at Lagunitas
DESCRIPTION:Garden Groove\nGarden Groove is a high-energy tribute band from Sacramento\, Northern California\, dedicated to capturing the essence of Sublime’s iconic sound. Blending ska\, punk\, reggae\, and rock\, we bring the raw energy and laid-back vibes that made Sublime legendary. Our setlist spans fan favorites and deep cuts\, delivering an authentic experience for both die-hard fans and newcomers alike. We keep the crowds dancing and singing along\, providing a full live band experience that’s unforgettable.
