SUMMARY:Rock & Raise: Live Music Fundraiser for Santa Rosa House Band
DESCRIPTION:Rock & Raise! Live music\, tacos\, auction & merch. Help send Santa Rosa House Band on tour. April 11 at Coyote Sonoma. \nRock & Raise – 2nd Annual Fundraiser for Santa Rosa House Band \nJoin us for an afternoon of live music\, great food\, and community as we come together to support the talented young musicians of the Santa Rosa House Band. \nRock & Raise is a free\, family-friendly event benefiting Santa Rosa House Band scholarships and the band’s upcoming summer tour\, helping students continue to grow as performers and musicians. \nEnjoy live performances from the Santa Rosa House Band\, with special guest appearances by the San Rafael House Band\, Ryan Woodard\, and Maryann Kafoa. \nWhile you’re there\, grab delicious food from Galvan’s Taco Truck\, enjoy a sweet treat\, browse House Band merch\, and participate in our online auction happening during the event. \n📅 April 11\, 2026 \n⏰ 4:00 – 8:00 PM \n📍 Coyote Sonoma – Healdsburg \nThis event is free and open to the entire community\, and everyone is welcome. \nA huge thank you to our generous sponsors: Coyote Sonoma (our hosts)\, Santa Rosa Auto Body\, Acme Burger\, BaseKamp Design\, and Amy’s Roofing & Solar. \nCome support these amazing young musicians and help us Rock & Raise for their future! \nView our online auction – goes live one week prior to the event and ends at 8pm on April 11th. https://givebutter.com/c/rockandraise2026
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/rock-raise-live-music-fundraiser-for-santa-rosa-house-band/
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma\, 44F Mill Street\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.607320;-122.872980
