SUMMARY:David Correa at Adobe Road Winery
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special Saturday acoustic live music set at Adobe Road Winery in Downtown Petaluma. Sip on award-winning wines while enjoying talented local musicians in a warm and inviting atmosphere. Choose from wines by the glass or bottle to discover new favorites. Reserve your spot on Tock and make it a memorable night of great music\, fine wine\, and good company! \nDavid Correa is a celebrated guitarist and composer blending Latin rhythms with Spanish and world music influences. Since 1999\, The David Correa Group has built a loyal fanbase across the Bay Area and beyond with energetic\, rhythm-driven performances. The group has toured extensively throughout the western U.S. and earned multiple accolades\, including three consecutive NORBAY Awards for Best Latin Band. Correa has released seven albums\, including New Moon and Alta Vista\, and has been featured alongside New Flamenco greats like Ottmar Liebert and Jesse Cook. His live shows promise a vibrant mix of soulful guitar\, rhythm\, and musical storytelling.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/david-correa-at-adobe-road-winery/
LOCATION:Adobe Road Winery\, 6 Petaluma Blvd N\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.234020;-122.639530
